  "status": "present",
  "value": "adjacency maps in both directions; addTask runs an iterative depth-first search from id over existing dependents and rejects when it reaches a prerequisite; getExecutionOrder runs Kahn's algorithm with a binary min-heap of ids, counting only added prerequisites as satisfiable. Complexity target: O(reachable) per addTask, O((V + E) log V) per getExecutionOrder/O(V + E) space.",
